### Create Priya Sharma's account
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Priya Sharma",
  "upiId": "priya@okaxis",
  "balance": 5000.0,
  "phoneNumber": "9876543210"
}

### Create Rahul
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul Verma",
  "upiId": "rahul@ybl",
  "balance": 3000.0,
  "phoneNumber": "9123456780"
}

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:8080/users

### Get user by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1

### Get user by UPI
GET http://localhost:8080/users/upi/rahul@ybl

### Create transaction
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderUpiId": "priya@okaxis",
  "receiverUpiId": "rahul@ybl",
  "amount": 500.0,
  "note": "dinner split"
}

### Test request body logging with @RequestBody
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Request Body Test",
  "upiId": "requestbody@test",
  "balance": 1000.0,
  "phoneNumber": "9000000000"
}

### Test request body logging without @RequestBody
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Without RequestBody Test",
  "upiId": "withoutrequestbody@test",
  "balance": 2000.0,
  "phoneNumber": "9111111111"
}